{
  "name": "Commercial Dumpster \u2014 Olive Steel, Twin Sloped Lids",
  "rationale": "A full-scale commercial refuse bin with individually constructed steel walls, subtly displaced front panels suggesting dents, rolled perimeter rails, reinforcing ribs, open-ended side lift pockets, and four grounded caster assemblies. Two closed black lids slope toward the front and include molded ribs, hinges, and raised handles. Small, low-contrast surface patches suggest worn paint without obscuring the construction. The lift pockets establish the overall width; the lids establish the depth and height. No floor or interior contents are included.",
